/-! # The Twelfth source tensor at field width `64`

The tensor block of the factory-ready Twelfth source (`twelfthSrcVecS w`, worker r8f) is the compact
literal of worker gtwelfth re-spaced to width `w` (`twelfthSrcXW w = twWidenT 4 w twelfthX12Lit`).
Every tensor plan of the Tenth-Twelfth identifications starts from it at width `64`, so the
re-spaced tensor is recorded here as a literal (`fbt12X64`, one kernel check `fbt12X64_eq`). -/

